 ♥ Liked Songs                │ Keys                                                                                                        
 ⏱ Recently Played            │ Chords are typed in sequence (g then l). Digits before a motion repeat it (15j).                            
 ♫ Discovery Mix              │ Rebind in ~/.config/ytm-go/keymap.toml — this page follows your bindings.                                   
 ──────────────────────────── │                                                                                                             
 Playlists                    │ Playback                                                                                                    
 Late night drives         87 │   space            Play / pause                                                                             
 Focus                     43 │   n                Next track                                                                               
                              │   p                Previous track                                                                           
                              │   .                Play a random track from the queue                                                       
                              │   C-r              Cycle repeat (off, all, one)                                                             
                              │   C-s              Toggle shuffle                                                                           
                              │   +                Volume up                                                                                
                              │   -                Volume down                                                                              
                              │   _                Mute                                                                                     
                              │   >                Seek forward                                                                             
                              │   <                Seek backward                                                                            
                              │   ^                Restart track                                                                            
                              │   l                Like / unlike current track                                                              
                              │   D                Discovery mix                                                                            
                              │                                                                                                             
                              │ Navigation                                                                                                  
                              │   j, down, C-n     Move down                                                                                
                              │   k, up, C-p       Move up                                                                                  
                              │   C-f, page_down   Page down                                                                                
                              │   C-b, page_up     Page up                                                                                  
                              │   g g, home        Go to top (or row N with a count)                                                        
                              │   G, end           Go to bottom (or row N with a count)                                                     
                              │   enter            Select / open                                                                            
                              │   tab              Focus next panel                                                                         
                              │   S-tab            Focus previous panel                                                                     
                              │   C-w h            Focus pane to the left                                                                   
                              │   C-w l            Focus pane to the right                                                                  
                              │   C-w w            Cycle pane focus                                                                         
 2 playlists                  │   r                Retry a failed load                                                                      
                                                                                                                                            
